338082314, -0.017562665045261383, -0.0010430865222588181, 0.012331061065196991, -0.03460783138871193, -0.048418618738651276, 0.006032112520188093, 0.0069094374775886536, 0.022058449685573578, -0.0020922375842928886, 0.009031997062265873, -0.009606098756194115, 0.01364906970411539, -0.021168995648622513, 0.006670902017503977, -0.019551808014512062, -0.03003118745982647, -0.010721959173679352, 0.008296176791191101, 0.0036831465549767017, 0.008025296963751316, 0.02901235967874527, -0.0016626717988401651], "index": 9, "object": "embedding"}], "model": "text-embedding-3-small", "object": "list", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8000, "total_tokens": 8000}}, "input": {"input": ["<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<story title=\"Harbour Shadows\" city=\"Sydney\" presentation=\"chat\" order=\"nonlinear\" xmlns=\"urn:whodunit:sms:1\">\n  <participants>\n    <person id=\"alex\" name=\"Alex Chen\" role=\"engineer\"/>\n    <person id=\"priya\" name=\"Priya Nair\" role=\"med_student\"/>\n    <person id=\"liam\" name=\"Liam O'Connor\" role=\"ferry_deckhand\"/>\n    <person id=\"zoe\" name=\"Zoe Williams\" role=\"journalist\"/>\n    <person id=\"marcus\" name=\"Marcus Nguyen\" role=\"founder\"/>\n    <person id=\"sienna\" name=\"Sienna Blake\" role=\"curator\"/>\n    <person id=\"jax\" name=\"Jax Morgan\" role=\"crew\"/>\n    <group id=\"six\" name=\"Six at the Quay\"/>\n  </participants>\n\n  <notes>\n    Messages are presented in conversational order (order=\"nonlinear\"). Timestamps (ts) reflect capture time across parallel threads. Attachments below annotate photos/audio mentioned in bodies.\n  </notes>\n\n  <chapter id=\"1\" title=\"Ferry Lights\">\n    <message id=\"m1\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:42:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The harbour looks electric — and I don’t mean the lights. Circular Quay, Wharf 3, 6pm. Don’t be late.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m2\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:42:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>On shift. Can slip us onto the 6:30 Manly ferry. Best view of the city turning on.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m3\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:43:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>If we’re playing tour guide, someone better bring some decent gossip. I’ve got a lead that's burning a hole in my notes.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m4\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:43:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Save it for another time, Zoe. Let’s just try to enjoy the lights for what they are.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m5\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:44:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Come on now, a truce for tonight. I’m determined to get photos of the Opera House sails from mid-harbour.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:44:25+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m in. Clinic ran late so I have to leave by 8. Long day.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m6a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:45:08+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Let's meet by the bronze seal statue. It's easier to spot in the crowd.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6b\" ts=\"202", " so I have to leave by 8. Long day.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m6a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:45:08+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Let's meet by the bronze seal statue. It's easier to spot in the crowd.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:46:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll bring my tiny recorder. The ambient sounds of the ferry make for great B-roll. You never know.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:47:31+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Bringing fingerless gloves. It’s freezing but I refuse to hide my new nails. A girl has her priorities.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:48:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I can grab some ginger tablets on my way. Seasick prevention for the weak-willed among us.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:49:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Ha. Just wait till a southerly hits. You’ll be worshipping those little tablets then.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m6f\" ts=\"2025-08-29T17:51:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Text me if you’re running behind. I still have to return some scrubs first.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m7\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:02:11+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: You saw Marcus’s Harbour Consulting transfer, right? Meet me at Wharf 3. Quietly.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m8a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:03:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: I’ve got a clipped invoice name: INV‑HC‑041 — “curation services.”</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m8\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:02:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Don’t put that in writing. Meet you at Wharf 3. We need to talk.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m9\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:04:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Bring that USB you borrowed. I need it back tonight. No excuses.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m10\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:04:37+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: You", ":04:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Bring that USB you borrowed. I need it back tonight. No excuses.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m10\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:04:37+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: You said it was just backup photos from the hackathon. Why the sudden rush?</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m11\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:21:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Heads up: the ferry's delayed. Some alarm went off earlier at the quay. We should be good for 6:45 now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m11a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:21:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>PA just asked folks to move forward for boarding checks. Stern deck is pretty empty right now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m11b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:22:06+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Busker on the quay has a crowd facing away from Wharf 3. Good window for the crew to reset things.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m12\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:23:52+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I'm at Wharf 3 under the big clock. The wind is absolutely freezing out here.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:27:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Here with hot chips. Don't be late or they'll be gone. Sharing is caring, but I have my limits.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m13a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:24:11+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>There's a street busker outside the Museum of Contemporary Art playing Crowded House. Quintessentially Sydney.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:25:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Just snapped the Harbour Bridge through a puddle. A perfect reflex mirror of steel and sky.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:25:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The queue at Wharf 3 is long but it’s moving. I’ll hold a few spots for us.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:26:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Wave if you see me. I'm in the high-vis jacket and a blue beanie. Can't miss me.</body>\n    </message>\n", "3 is long but it’s moving. I’ll hold a few spots for us.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:26:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Wave if you see me. I'm in the high-vis jacket and a blue beanie. Can't miss me.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:26:38+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Buying a scarf from the kiosk. This wind is savage. I should have dressed warmer.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13f\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:27:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Extra chips for sharing. No flaking on me now, people.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13g\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:28:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>A ferry horn just made a kid cry and then immediately laugh. I kind of know the feeling.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m13h\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:29:48+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Noticing a fire boat near the quay. Lights are on but no siren. Strange.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m14\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:48:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Onboard now, top deck. The city looks electric from here. Truly something else.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m14a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:48:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Smells like salt and something metallic, like battery acid. I love it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m14b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:48:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Stay clear of the yellow lines, everyone. The deck gets surprisingly slick out here. Safety first.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m14c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:48:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Recorder is rolling. Say something poetic for me, Sienna. Don't be shy.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m14d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:48:45+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The sails are breathing tonight.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m14e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:49:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s poetic enough. Just don’t drop that expensive recorder overboard.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m15\" ts", "\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The sails are breathing tonight.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m14e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:49:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s poetic enough. Just don’t drop that expensive recorder overboard.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m15\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:48:54+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Also, for your information: that USB is encrypted. Marcus, what’s actually on it? This is getting weird.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m16\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:49:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Drop it. Enjoy the view.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m17\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:49:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Forget the drive. The sails look like they’re breathing tonight. It’s unreal.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m18\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:50:30+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Someone’s left a backpack under the bench by the stern. Anyone see who it belongs to?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m18a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:50:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Photo attached: It’s a black canvas bag, with paint flecks on the strap. Looks familiar.</body>\n      <attachment type=\"image\" file=\"IMG_20250829_185039.jpg\" exif=\"ISO3200;18:50:39;f/1.8\"/>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m18b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:50:50+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Did anyone see who might have left it there? We should probably let someone know.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m19\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:50:57+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Probably just a tourist. Leave it for lost property. I’ll log it when we dock. No stress.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m19a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:51:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <body>DM: Want me to move it closer to the wall, out of the way?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m19b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:51:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Nah, just leave it exactly where it is. I’ll tag it properly later. Thanks though.</body>\n    </message>    <message id=\"m19d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:52:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"z", " ts=\"2025-08-29T18:51:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Nah, just leave it exactly where it is. I’ll tag it properly later. Thanks though.</body>\n    </message>    <message id=\"m19d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:52:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Focus, people: the fireworks reflection on the glass towers. That's some unreal bokeh. A photographer's dream.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m20\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:52:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <body>DM: Your hands are shaking. Are you okay? You seem on edge.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m21\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:52:38+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <body>DM: It’s been a long shift. The wind just cuts right through you out here on the water.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m22\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:53:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <body>DM: So, are we good for that package or not? I need to know.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:54:11+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"liam\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: Not over text. We'll talk about it later. End of discussion.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:55:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Okay, quick group photo and then everyone pockets their phones. Let's live a little, shall we?</body>\n      <attachment type=\"image\" file=\"GROUP_20250829_185502.jpg\" exif=\"flash;18:55:02;wide\"/>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:55:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Timer is set for 3 seconds. Everyone squeeze in and try to look happy!</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:55:45+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The wind just stole my beanie. A seagull owes me $20. The audacity.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:56:08+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Posting to our chat only. No public tags, please. Let's keep this one for us.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:56:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The harbour is glassing", "10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Posting to our chat only. No public tags, please. Let's keep this one for us.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:56:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The harbour is glassing over now. The reflection looks like it’s breathing. So serene.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m23f\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:56:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <body>DM: You and your beautiful metaphors. Keep them coming. They're the highlight of my night.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m24\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:57:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The ferry just slowed down near Kirribilli. There are police lights along the shore. What’s going on?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m25\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:57:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Marcus, where did you disappear to? You were just here.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:58:15+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He’s on the lower deck. He said he was feeling sick all of a sudden.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m26a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:58:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m fine, really. Just needed some fresh air and fewer pointed questions. It was getting intense.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:59:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Keep an eye on that bag. A crew member keeps glancing at it. Something's not right.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:59:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Which one? The one with the yellow gloves and the shaved head?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T18:59:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Yep, that's the one. He's the same guy Liam was chatting with earlier. I have a bad feeling.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:00:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The wind’s really picking up now. Hold onto the rails if you’re moving around. Seriously.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26f\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:00:47+10:00", ">\n    <message id=\"m26e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:00:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The wind’s really picking up now. Hold onto the rails if you’re moving around. Seriously.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m26f\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:00:47+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The Opera House is behind us now. The bridge towers look like ancient watchmen in the dark.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m27\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:01:08+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I still can’t unlock this USB. It keeps asking for a passphrase. What are you hiding, Marcus?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m28\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:01:31+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Try ‘HarbourLights’. It’s worth a shot. People are often predictable.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m29\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:01:47+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>No luck. Phrase prompt persists. Strong encryption.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m30\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:03:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Delete anything and everything you saw. Please. For your own good.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m31\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:03:50+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: What in the world did you drag us into, Marcus? This is serious.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m31a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:04:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Not here. People listen on boats. Bring the USB tomorrow. We need to talk, face to face.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m31b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:04:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: He’s completely dodging. If I suddenly vanish, publish everything you have. I’m not kidding.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m31c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:04:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Don’t be so dramatic. But yes, everything is backed up. I've got your back.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m31d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:04:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Did anyone else just feel the ferry lurch a bit? That was a strange jolt.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m32\" ts=\"2025-08-29", " I've got your back.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m31d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:04:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Did anyone else just feel the ferry lurch a bit? That was a strange jolt.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m32\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:05:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Wait, where’s Liam? Has anyone seen him in the last few minutes?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m33\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:05:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I thought he went to talk to the captain about something. He looked stressed.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m34\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:05:45+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>There’s a jacket by the rail near the stern. It looks just like his. Oh my god.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m35\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:06:11+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Call triple zero right now! Someone’s gone overboard! This is not a drill!</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m36\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:06:30+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m pulling the emergency alarm right now. Stay calm, everyone.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m36a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:06:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Throw the ring buoy! Port side! I can’t see him in the water. It’s too dark.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m36b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:07:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Triple zero is on speaker. They’re alerting the Marine Area Command immediately. Help is on the way.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m36c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:07:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The crew is deploying a ladder. I’m scanning the water with my flashlight. The waves are like black glass.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m36d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:07:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I hear a strange banging sound from below. Is it the engine room? Or the hull slapping against something?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m36e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:07:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m on the lower deck, starboard side. No sighting of him yet. I'm looking as hard as I can.</body>\n   ", " banging sound from below. Is it the engine room? Or the hull slapping against something?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m36e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:07:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m on the lower deck, starboard side. No sighting of him yet. I'm looking as hard as I can.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m37\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:08:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They’re bringing someone up onto the deck. It’s Liam. He looks… oh god.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m38\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:08:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m with the crew now. I'm starting compressions. Give us some space, please!</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m39\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:10:07+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>His pupils are unresponsive. There's no pulse. I… I’m so incredibly sorry, everyone. He's gone.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m39a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:10:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The crew is logging the incident time. Approximately 19:05. Cold shock was likely a factor. Keep the space clear.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m39b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:11:06+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Recording incident details. Footing slick at stern rail.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m39c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:11:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>There’s a thin, sharp mark on his wrist. It looks like a fishing line burn. How did that get there?</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m40\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:12:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Marcus was arguing with him by the stern no more than ten minutes ago. I saw it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m41\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:13:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: I saw a fresh bruise on Liam’s wrist earlier tonight. I should have said something.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m41a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:13:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: That lines up with the sharp snap I think I heard on my recording. Save all your notes. Every detail matters now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m41b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:13:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\""], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_4401da73ffe58cb04a03eba7c5b5b9169a98cd9e1decbb7a4ef98f6391f3d961_v2"}